{
  "protocol": "phase-c-llm-sr-ode-transcriptions-1",
  "status": "proposed_pending_review",
  "source_run": "phase-c-llm-sr-hosted-120b-v1",
  "source_plan_sha256": "ba3d23cdbad28bd4c165154a3ea86a67a709df2b438e88d0f3b40af1a40f3bd4",
  "rules": {
    "filter": "A first-order filter recursion z[k] = a*z[k-1] + (1-a)*u, with 0 <= a < 1, becomes dz/dt = (u - z)/T, where T is the recursion's mean delay (the centroid of its impulse response): T = D*a/(1-a) when u is read at the current row k, and T = D/(1-a) when it is read at the previous row k-1. The ODE keeps the filter's gain and its lag behind a ramp. A forward- or backward-Euler filter written with a time constant tau gets T = tau; a copy of the previous row (a = 0) gets T = D. A rearranged form, z[k] = z[k-1] + (1-a)*(u - z[k-1]), is the same filter.",
    "euler": "Any other row recursion z[k] = z[k-1] + s*g(row values), including a filter whose weight a lies outside (0, 1), is read as one explicit-Euler step: dz/dt = s*g/D, with s the program's own step multiplier (1 if none).",
    "lag": "A value from the previous row, x[k-1], used beside the current one is the filter rule's copy of the previous row: a state x_prev with d(x_prev)/dt = (x - x_prev)/D. A backward difference x[k] - x[k-1] becomes x - x_prev.",
    "initial": "Every hidden state starts at the program's own first-row value, written as an expression of first-row observations, inputs, covariates and coefficients.",
    "guard": "A guard that cannot change any value on the public domain is dropped: a division guard max(area, eps) or area > eps on a surveyed area (every area is 800 or 1200 m^2), the replacement of non-finite values by 0 or NaN masks (they act only where the expression is undefined), and a clamp on a hidden state that its ODE keeps in range (nonnegative inputs and start). Every other guard is kept, written with max, min, clip or heaviside.",
    "coefficients": "Coefficients are the sealed values after the program's own handling (defaults, padding, clamps such as max(p, 0)); branches on coefficients are resolved with them and only the branch taken is transcribed. Names are the program's, prefixed with the target where a pick has several programs; a name that is a grammar function gains a suffix (gamma -> gamma_c).",
    "direct": "Code of the current values is rewritten exactly: np.where becomes heaviside, max or min; np.clip clip; np.maximum and np.minimum max and min; np.power **.",
    "time_unit": "A program that steps its recursions in rows, or with a hard-coded dt, is converted to the cell's time unit through the sample interval D: 1 min (Dalla Man), 0.1 (CSTR, alien device) or 4 min (detention). Its output is already a derivative in the cell's unit: LLM-SR fitted it to numpy.gradient labels."
  },
